      "id": "claim_8e6c0d6dd09c4cdda258f7d55a7331a1",
      "statement": "DUS-07 approvals require: data-owner plus Privacy Office sign-off via Collibra DAR (~15 business days) for Restricted dataset access; a Privacy Impact Assessment (~4 weeks) for new client-facing uses of client data; and joint Privacy Office + FCC approval (generally not granted) for using financial-crimes data outside FCC purposes.",
